 pastel and other art mediums by Dr. Southworth and ZOSU\n- Includes mini-game to locate all of the artifacts\n- Includes bonus features with the ability to draw on a set of canvases and to be able to climb on most objects\n- Paintings scaled for maximum VR effectiveness\n- All paintings based on direct onsite inspiration of the painted content\n- Produced my solo indie hobby studios ZOSU Studios LLC", "short_description": "- Full gallery with over 300 pastel paintings from the award winning artist Dr. James Southworth\n- Beautiful paintings from around the world including beautiful locations in Europe the Northwest USA and more\n- Additional bonus paintings in pastel and other art mediums by Dr. Southworth and ZOSU\n- Includes mini-game to locate all of the artifacts\n- Includes bonus feature with ability to draw on a set of canvases\n- Produced my solo indie hobby studios ZOSU Studios LLC"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.zosustudio.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.zosustudio.com/", "publisher_name": "ZOSU Studios LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.zosustudios.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1064214587538033"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "548198794889445"},